  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n( {frac{{( {{{a}} {{ + }} {{x}}} )( {{{a}}{{{x}}{²}}{{ - }} {{{x}}{³}}} )}}{{{{{a}}{³}}{{ + }} {{{x}}{³}}}} {{ times }} frac{{{{{a}}{²}}{{ - }} {{ax}} {{ + }} {{{x}}{²}}}}{{{{{a}}{²}}{{{x}}{²}}{{ + }} {{{x}}{⁴}}}}} ){{ div }} frac{{( {{{{a}}{²}}{{ - }} {{2ax}} {{ + }} {{{x}}{²}}} )( {{{a}} {{ - }} {{x}}} )}}{{( {{{{a}}{⁴}}{{ - }} {{{x}}{⁴}}} )}}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(a - b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)\n\na² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n( {frac{{( {{{a}} {{ + }} {{x}}} )( {{{a}}{{{x}}{²}}{{ - }} {{{x}}{³}}} )}}{{{{{a}}{³}}{{ + }} {{{x}}{³}}}} {{ times }} frac{{{{{a}}{²}}{{ - }} {{ax}} {{ + }} {{{x}}{²}}}}{{{{{a}}{²}}{{{x}}{²}}{{ + }} {{{x}}{⁴}}}}} ){{ div }} frac{{( {{{{a}}{²}}{{ - }} {{2ax}} {{ + }} {{{x}}{²}}} )( {{{a}} {{ - }} {{x}}} )}}{{( {{{{a}}{⁴}}{{ - }} {{{x}}{⁴}}} )}}\n\n⇒ ((x²(a+x)(a-x))/((a+x)(a²-ax+x²))times((a²-ax+x²))/(x²(a²+x²)))div((a-x)²(a-x))/((a⁴-x⁴))\n\n⇒ (((a-x))/((a²+x²)))div((a-x)²(a-x))/((a⁴-x⁴))\n\n⇒ ((a-x))/((a²+x²))times((a⁴-x⁴))/((a-x)³)\n\n⇒ ((a-x))/((a²+x²))times((a+x)(a-x)(a²+x²))/((a-x)³)\n\n⇒ ((a+x))/((a-x))\n\n**∴ Required answer is frac{{{{a}} {{ + }} {{x}}}}{{{{a}} {{ - }} {{x}}}}.**",
